<div class="install-page">
  <h1>Install status</h1>

  <div class="status">
    <strong>There is no supported tsz release to install during the clean-slate rewrite.</strong>
    The previous compiler and its distribution artifacts were retired. Existing release assets describe that deleted implementation, not the new R0 foundation.
  </div>

  <p>
    npm packages, <code>npx try-tsz</code>, shell and PowerShell installers, Cargo installation, daily builds, and production binaries are unavailable until a later milestone explicitly restores them.
    Please do not use an old package or release to evaluate the rewrite.
  </p>

  <p>
    Contributor-built binaries are validation artifacts only. The roadmap restores product distribution after compatibility has a trustworthy foundation, and restores WASM after the service API is stable.
  </p>

  <p>
    Follow the <a href="https://github.com/tsz-org/tsz/blob/main/docs/plan/ROADMAP.md">clean-slate roadmap</a> and repository pull requests for exact capability evidence.
  </p>
</div>
